Spynach is a Python reimplementation of the Spinach spin dynamics kernel
(https://spindynamics.org); its `easyspyn` package is a reimplementation of
EasySpin (https://easyspin.org); its `ctps` package is a port of the
author's earlier MATLAB (CCCP.m) and C++ (CCCP++) programs for coherence
pathway selection; its `spyndynamica` package is a port of SpinDynamica
(https://www.spindynamica.soton.ac.uk). This licence derives from the MIT
licences of Spinach (Ilya Kuprov) and EasySpin (Stefan Stoll and other
contributors); both notices are reproduced below, followed by the terms of
use of SpinDynamica.

